// Potential APT FIN7 POWERHOLD Execution | T1059.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/FIN7/posh_ps_apt_fin7_powerhold.yml
powershell.file.script_block_text:*$env\:APPDATA* AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*function\ MainPayload* AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*\:\:WriteAllBytes* AND powershell.file.script_block_text:*wscript.exe*
